> period sin(x: real)
period of sin(x):
  fundamental period 2*pi ≈ 6.283185307
  proved symbolically: sin(x) has period 2*pi; x occurs only inside them, so f(x + p) = f(x).  Smallest: no p/k (2 <= k <= 64) is a period (checked at 997 points)
